CSS  Cascading style sheet

It is used to design the html elements

Bootstrap
tailwind CSS

Basic Css Syntax:

element{
    property:value;
}

3 ways to connect css part
----------------------------

1. inline Css
2. internal css 
3. External Css


selectors:
----------------------------
1. #id selectors
2. .class selectors
3. element selectors
4. universal selector  (*)
5. group selector   table,tr,th,td{border:2px solid red}


block vs inline
----------------------------
block  <h1></h1>.....  (width:100%)
inline  img,a,span,button,input  (width:depends on content)


semantic and non-semantic
----------------------------

semantic--- meaning ful tag <header></header><footer></footer><nav></nav>

non-sementic----div,span


background-property
----------------------------

1. background-color
2. background-image 
3. background-position
4. back